  "interpretation": "Premature/stale ready is a source contract gap. Audited normal consumers follow stack initialization, so this does not demonstrate low-entropy material generated or used on hardware.",
  "implementation": "Atomic try-lock, no platform mutex. revoke closes admission immediately and reports false while fill remains active; shutdown must wait for true. Lost-source or failed/partial fill closes admission; temporary scratch prevents partial output on failure.",
  "target_integration": "Not wired. Replace raw random references with guard, implement bounded controller/config readiness probe, activate only after successful init, revoke/drain before stop/deinit without holding callback locks. Do not disable source on drain timeout.",
